{"parse": {"title": "TTSC-03", "pageid": 134758, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTSC-02\" title=\"TTSC-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTSC-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTSC-04\" title=\"TTSC-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTSC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.85.AC.E5.85.B1.E8.B4.A2.E4.BA.A7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"公共财产\">公共财产</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 公共财产</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Public Property</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>属<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>所<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>空<span class=\"color-value\"></span>间<span class=\"color-value\"></span>：<span class=\"color-value\"></span>挑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>战<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>判<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>疑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>争<span class=\"color-value\"></span>执<span class=\"color-value\"></span>皆<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>发<span class=\"color-value\"></span>生<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3510103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuezoulang\"><img alt=\"daxuezoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/600px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/900px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/1200px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">见习执夜Ⅰ：</div><div>现场调查的结果怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">见习执夜Ⅱ：</div><div>和前三起命案非常类似，基本可以确定是系列性案件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">见习执夜Ⅱ：</div><div>作案间隔正在缩短，代表凶手已经逐渐熟悉其行凶方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">见习执夜Ⅱ：</div><div>一致的死状，一致的密室，死前没有任何异常行为……周围的居民都认为是在闹鬼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">见习执夜Ⅰ：</div><div>这比闹鬼还可怕。也同之前一样，没有找到任何有犯罪动机的嫌疑人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">见习执夜Ⅱ：</div><div>别提了，今晚又得加班整理口供。死者生前欠了一屁股债，想动手的人能塞满这条走廊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-646401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">见习执夜Ⅰ：</div><div>唉，就没有哪天是清闲的……我本来还想去参加过几天的祭祀活动呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-646501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">见习执夜Ⅱ：</div><div>“暴雨”之下，没有节假日！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>见习执夜人们迈着急匆匆的步伐走远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>访客接待处，机械女孩默默等待着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>填完这张《夜巡特遣调解情况表》，你就可以走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>谢谢！让我看看表格——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>姓名，莱瑟姆。年龄，现在是多少年？算了，应该是97岁吧。种族，意识唤醒者……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>顺带一提，我们已经在墨西哥城了吗？墨西哥的首都？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>当然。这里是墨西哥城，索卡洛广场，夜巡特遣管理局临时驻外机构。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>在接到你发出的求助讯号时，我们还以为是郊外又发生了新的命案……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>命案？噢不！并没有这么严重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她并没有听出接待员的言外之意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>感谢执夜人，没有你们，我一辈子都走不出那片可怕的沙漠了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>回到基金会之后，我会给大家写感谢信的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>话说，执夜队是否能替我检查一番，我的传送软盘究竟出了什么问题？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>我可以把它们都留在这里，过两天再来取走——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>没想到只是几头沙漠魔鬼蜥蜴！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接待员粗暴地收起填写完毕的表格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>真是没完没了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>几天前，一个基金会职员带着调查令出现，带走了一大批重要资料，弄得档案处手忙脚乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>才过没多久，又来一个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>算了，针对你们圣洛夫基金会职员浪费夜巡特遣人力的问题，我会统一提起投诉的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>现在你可以离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>请稍等，女士！我这次前来墨西哥城，是想要寻找一种神秘学材料的源头。详情……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接待员并没有理会面前的机械女孩，准备将她撵出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>快离开吧，我们没空和沙漠魔鬼蜥蜴玩过家家！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>但这次的事件也许和重塑之手有关。我希望能得到执夜队的协助！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>“也许”？你干脆说重塑之手要占领基金会得了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>双方僵持不下之时，两名归来的执夜人注意到了走廊里发生的小争执。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>嘿，是你，莱瑟姆！你怎么在这儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>黑鹮女士，阿兰先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>你们来得正好，我需要你们的帮助！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>执夜人迅速判断了眼前的局势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>这位意识唤醒者女孩是我们的朋友。把她交给我们吧，劳拉，晚些请你喝普逵酒[Pulque]，就在我们之前聚餐的酒馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>好吧，黑鹮女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"646301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"646301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-646301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-646301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">接待员：</div><div>另外，我的名字是卡塔丽娜。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_5_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_5_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_5_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>执夜人与副手带领着拜访者步入建筑恢弘的大厅。<br />自神秘学藏品管理部失窃一案后，他们已许久未见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>哇——这里可真漂亮！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>这栋建筑原本是墨西哥城人民图书馆，被夜巡特遣管理局临时征用为驻外分部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>等执夜队撤离，这里就会重新变回图书馆，回归民用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们在巨幅的室内壁画前停下脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>壁画一侧，面容冷峻的青年们手持枪械，展望着太阳、大地与未来的场景；另一侧，农妇们专心致志地处理着手中丰收的玉米。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>稍等！我知道这个——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女孩娴熟地更换了自己脑袋中的胶片，变得侃侃而谈起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>对于这些大型壁画，我们可以在上楼梯的过程中，从不同的角度来感知它！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>观赏者可以在自由的阅读过程中，来构建属于他们的墨西哥故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-311211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>它是如此的神圣，如此温柔，完美地将古老的传统与现代斗争联系在了一起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>没想到你懂得还不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-311212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>当然，我在纪录片里看到过。我还把内容拷贝下来了呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“电影艺术大师”的视线落在壁画留白的中心处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>这幅壁画，它还没有完成吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>我得澄清，它的“未完待续”和执夜队入驻没有关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>这些公共壁画，都是由政府公共教育部委托艺术家们绘制的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>在不久前，这位艺术家就失踪了，壁画也不了了之——事实上，这段时间失踪的人实在太多了。他并非个例。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>听闻绘制这幅壁画的，是一位在这个时代备受关注的新锐。我们尝试调查过，但他卷入了神秘学家黑帮的械斗之中。真是可惜了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>报纸上说的什么来着——“题材和技术的革新”“突破的技法”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>咳咳，我可不懂这些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>执夜人打断了这场重逢的闲谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-631401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-631401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-631401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>我们是在最近才被调派至这儿的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>在这个“暴雨”时代里，墨西哥城的外来人口激增，成了神秘学家犯罪的温床。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>噢噢——！这一切都和《灰车》里拍的一样！传奇的灰车党，老练的外国人盗贼，日益精进的现代化犯罪手段！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女孩快速更换了脑袋里的胶片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>盗贼伪装成体面的公职人员，手持带有将军签名的搜查令，自若地出入受害者的宅邸——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>而这一切的电影艺术，又反过来引起了盗贼们的争相模仿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>是的，哪怕总部增派了人手，每天依旧忙得连喝咖啡的时间都没有……这两天还有外交官来访！他就不能挑个别的时间吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>请见谅，刚刚卡塔丽娜并不是故意态度恶劣的。只是大家都有点焦头烂额了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>完全没关系。我能理解，每次“暴雨”过后的基金会也是这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>最近的墨西哥城并不安全……具体的情况我不能透露，但无论你要做什么，都要小心一些，莱瑟姆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>刚刚在访客接待处，你说你想要在墨西哥城寻找什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>一种神秘学材料！消息源说，重塑之手将它伪装成矿物颜料走私，源头正是这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“记忆”在她脑袋里飞速倒转，她连忙摄取了其中一帧，将记录的信息向面前的执夜人交代清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>重塑之手。矿物颜料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>……起死回生术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听见其中的关键词，执夜人与副手对视一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>有些奇怪，墨西哥城并非他们在这个时代主要活动的城市。至于颜料走私——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>夜巡特遣管理局内没有任何相关的案件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>怎么会——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>但我想，也许有人能够帮到你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>有很多事，原本生活在这个时代的人们，要比我们这些外来者更为清楚——我可以给你介绍一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>她受雇于夜巡特遣管理局驻外机构，偶尔会替我们清理犯罪现场，是一名除灵师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>基于最新的《暴雨应急人事调动法案》，她有权限知晓“暴雨”的部分真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>犯罪现场……的除灵师？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女孩想象了一下对方工作的内容，连忙闭上了嘴巴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>她是存在于阴影的耳目，在这座城市，基本没有她不知道的消息——传闻说，她能够感受到一些普通人无法知晓的存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>我对此很感兴趣。我有预感，她必定是个执夜人的好苗子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>我本想推荐她参加执夜人的选拔，相信以她的能力，通过并不难。但她拒绝了，还表现得十分抗拒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>莱瑟姆，也许你有办法说动她，协助你的调查，甚至于，加入我们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>但这一定需要相当的沟通技巧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>非常感谢你们，黑鹮女士，阿兰先生！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_5_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_5_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Cg-3_5_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尽管并未获得足够的情报，机械女孩仍心满意足地离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在目送她离去后，副手不解地看向身侧正在沉思的执夜人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>矿物颜料……你应该知道迪马斯最近也在找这个东西吧，就是那个从欧洲分部调过来的家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>前几天我听见他在四处打探，还在翻找那些好几次“暴雨”前的案件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>你觉得是因为什么，执夜队里也有人在找这个玩意儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>哈，迪马斯，倒是让我想起了一位曾经的朋友呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>你认识刻雷乌斯吗？在刻雷乌斯还是保民官的时候，迪马斯是他最忠诚的下属之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>而现在，他在基金会得到了一些大人物的赏识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>无论迪马斯和莱瑟姆，是出于什么原因在行动，背后又代表着谁，也许，让双方都得到这种颜料，才是最好的做法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敏锐的执夜人露出高深莫测的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑鹮：</div><div>如今欧洲……现在的基金会，所处的可不是一个安稳的时局啊，布莱恩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>这就是你常说的“中庸之道”吗？你们的政治智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-631501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">副手：</div><div>顺带一提，我是阿兰。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTSC-03"}}